  "claim": "The one on-time regular map of genus at least 2 among 1,762 read in which some ring has no closest contact reached by a single shortest route, a map of S6 of type (6,6), genus 61, 120 rings: its two such rings (exchanged by the half-turn about the target) each have three closest contacts at distance 9 reached by 2, 3 and 2 shortest routes, and every pair of these routes closes a loop that is not null-homologous mod 2, so each route comes from a different lift of the target: the odd count 3 is a three-way tie between lifts.",
